            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito also asked whether the case was denied because the petitioner was pro se."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d170aa8c7f1e7e94becff9af62ce3c2a77296b82bfcf2c3bbff3a935f6db6e4a",
            "evidence_ids": [
